    "author": "1468146891464470528",
    "displayName": "1468146891464470528",
    "text": "\ud83d\udea8 | EXCLUSIVE : NICO GONZ\u00c1LEZ \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8\n\nNewcastle United reach an agreement with Nico Gonz\u00e1lez over personal terms, five-year contract until June 2031! \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8\ud83d\udea8\u26ab\ufe0f\u26aa\ufe0f#NUFC\n\nNico Gonz\u00e1lez will earn around \u00a37.5m per season including bonuses, with the player now giving his GREEN-LIGHT to the move. Everything agreed on personal terms. \ud83e\udd1d\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\udcb0\n\nAll that remains is an agreement between Newcastle United and Manchester City over the transfer fee, with City demanding \u00a360m package for Nico Gonz\u00e1lez. \ud83d\udc40\ud83d\udca3\n\nNewcastle United are currently offering a \u00a350m package, with negotiations expected to continue between the two clubs in the next days. NUFC want to close the gap. \ud83d\udcb0\ud83e\udd1d\ud83c\udffb\n\nNico Gonz\u00e1lez is now waiting for the two clubs to reach an agreement, with his side of the deal completely sorted and Newcastle working to complete the transfer. \u23f3\ufe0f\u26ab\ufe0f\u26aa\ufe0f",
    "createdAt": "Mon Aug 24 08:55:43 +0000 2026",
    "url": "https://x.com/KrrishFT/status/2091811680070324395"
  },
